DISCLAIMER

This skill produces procurement decision-support material. It does not
constitute legal advice, an audit opinion, a credit report, or a fraud
determination. It does not replace customs AEO verification, third-party
factory audits, bank credit checks, legal due diligence, or origin
verification.

The bundled example documents marked "SIMULATED / 模拟" are fictional samples
created to demonstrate consistency checks. No real company has issued an offer
or supplied those documents to the buyer.

No risk score, rating or grading is produced by this skill by design.
